5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am tired of burying initiatives that change nothing. I need to see what actually worked before.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The building is already full. I need to know if we have the physical space to absorb this.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Approvals are easy. The real risk is when the arrangement breaks in year two. I will check the failures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Rosters are where the pressure lands. I need to see who is actually available to do the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must know what this money can truly build. I will look at the actual allocation and the running costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, yes. If it broke before, it will break again. I am checking the readmission data.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the ledger is key. I am also looking at the booking system to see current capacity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I am reviewing the board minutes. Joint ventures often fail on shared responsibility.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, the booking system is blind to ad-hoc work. I am checking the staffing review.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, staffing is the backbone. I will also check the regional fund tariffs to understand revenue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the readmission figures. Data beats memory.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the rooms and parking coverage. Physical limits are hard limits.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will examine the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the development allocation in the ledger.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
